.TH CHARDEMO 1
.SH NAME
chardemo \- scrolling landscape demo
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/chardemo
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I CharDemo
is a scrolling landscape demo.
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
Arrow keys pan a generated landscape of water, land, and trees. Enter regenerates the map.
.PP
The controls are:
.TF space
.TP
.B arrows
Scroll map
.TP
.B Enter
Restart / regenerate
.TP
.B Esc / q
Quit
.PD
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/temple/chardemo.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR temple (1),
.IR wm (1)
